<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49983" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱέραξ</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱκος</span>, ὁ</span>, 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴρηξ</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηκος</span></span> (the longer form
		first in <i><span class="en">
			Alcm.
			28
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Andr.</u>
			1141
		</span></i>, Ps.-Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Eq.</u>
			1052
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hawk,
				falcon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴρηξ ὠκύπτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.62
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				819
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				212
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				620a17
			</span></i>; sacred to Apollo, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				516
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<i>fish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				68
			</span></i> (in 
				Dor.
			 form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱάραξ</span></b> ),
			Epaenet. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.329a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> name for a
			grade of initiates in Mithras-worship, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> name of a
				<i>bandage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fasc.</u>
				12
			</span></i>.</div>
